Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:38.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}反正都会赢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:40.95,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}你看见了吗 那就享受吧
