Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.44,0:00:56.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.02,0:00:58.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.81,0:01:01.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.88,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.98,0:01:05.25,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.40,0:01:07.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁也不能改写我的故事
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.43,0:01:24.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}一路都是独自一人生存
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.19,0:01:26.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}外面是风暴席卷电闪雷鸣
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}钟声响起 Ding Ding Dong
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.63,0:01:28.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}就像金刚
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.75,0:01:31.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最难的十大任务 正好让我扬名立万统领天下
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.97,0:01:35.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我停不下来 怪物转生 从零转生 豪赌一把
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}每次下注我都倾家荡产
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.43,0:01:38.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}但我根本不在意
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.35,0:01:38.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}反正都会赢回来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.23,0:01:40.95,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}你看见了吗 那就享受吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.09,0:01:42.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}走在街上毛线帽戴好
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.88,0:01:43.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我可是从不厌战
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.97,0:01:45.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁叫我报酬总是拿双份
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.29,0:01:47.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}吃进去多少都是荣耀
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.89,0:01:49.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最终像这样成为我血肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.71,0:01:52.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.65,0:01:55.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.14,0:01:56.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.98,0:01:59.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.18,0:02:03.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.21,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,1570,1670)}{\t(500,550,\fscx125\fscy60)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.09,0:02:05.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\move(960,1040,960,1065,1020,1120)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.80,0:02:07.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.63,0:02:09.31,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.55,0:02:13.24,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,3590,3690)}{\t(2130,2180,\fscx125\fscy60)}我们浴火而生在当下
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.73,0:02:12.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\pos(960,1040)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.05,0:02:14.74,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\move(960,1040,960,1065,90,190)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.79,0:02:18.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们浴火而生
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.11,0:02:20.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}前往下片天地
